{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1200,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01b34725236cea2102e73e21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还想再去各处的咖啡厅坐坐呢。\r\n软绵绵的松饼……\r\n那真的好好吃……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d3368efe3e654d7ab82d40ddef1d78566793ef322965c80676b480a4cabe893",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aee2de13c24754d81232efe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐，今年也麻烦你了。\r\n……所以，训练员打算吃几块年糕呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af2717c627a9e9959b97f3bba0dc41d297bdf23d491dc97e92f22d37ae19f36f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a09f83db1783755cd3f91b95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来今天是情人节啊……\r\n会吃到怎样的巧克力呢……\r\n一整天都充满了期待呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e11f1e2d80703f65e86bd9f1b4fc996b4a57b7f808cce9ac0752c11cfb377851",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db2b233fdc28ea609e80992",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我尝试做了巧克力。因为很认真\r\n试味道的，所以变得有点小颗……\r\n请收下吧，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b351300bc9a74a9ff39ee9852fd42bfbc298530102226ab35c1da7bd0d1525",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160ba5697344b9cc36b8c149",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕啊……思念远方的人，\r\n那种心情我似乎能理解呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "272ff57d2961616471f5cedab6424306bd310d5078773dbb1ec0891b59a89427",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:158f36589a4fa6e25b866c95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然打算要去讨点心的话，\r\n也该事先准备好恶作剧的部分……\r\n嗯……拉袖子吓人怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "51c7cd0178c0544837729e98755e163e2b085442cc9e85df0177dff44c1bf739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017809a870d0f2459b5385ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我以为圣诞老人有很多个……\r\n因为家乡的大家都会扮成圣诞老人\r\n来给我礼物……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fba9ac25c220e4cfef8dd04ecddfe6b86eb07e8ed70d68e0af97506994918e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02faf1f521e47bf96d5ddc2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你喜欢土手煮吗？\r\n那是很适合欢乐夜晚的美食。\r\n我会负责做，所以希望你可以一起吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "585e9c90f6ebf61e10f24d7132a382d9ce755d4d60b8c76c6b20ec0336f5cdc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84d893a337d24497d76b737",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d274fbb8726de6608c24a61f78c8db4bbc7d74e06bb6efd0e871dfbf618e2a0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d9104b94a76192d6a41a06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年要过完啦……真快。\r\n但我确实感觉到自己的成长。\r\n希望明年可以有更大的进步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4d36c06f436f7f597a3bbf15e44b1cc6d260725870f63c27137000727554575",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3007914890a91ccdb907e6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\r\n商店街有一家蛋糕很好吃的店哦。\r\n要不要一起去呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba44142701182a2813de79846927c2e41e0c7c56e0010b162513ad2bdbd9586b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f34c897cd1354ce8720d93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，祝你生日快乐。\r\n呵呵……真奇怪，\r\n怎么连我也跟着开心了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a93e1f5721ec48fbeb06e4a62840e69f63fb01680f624e378d498c2bef69c1f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113abbd14a8e0ca3987f011b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有很多朋友一起帮我庆生……\r\n虽然是很开心的事情，\r\n但却觉得有点不好意思呢……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f7d87c209675d5ab240900941ae782a15beafa3ec86c60e8934c0d515117b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed513f80fd4a4b662bd17c66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也是来祝贺的吗？我很开心哦。\r\n……真奇怪，我怎么好像刚蒸好的\r\n馒头一样，整个人热呼呼的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa18acccb832246d773fa6d564e6bdd05be9e2806e7508d3d0f05b5a26ae16c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8769309f6eba6c2fbf7e4ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到新的公告了。\r\n是不是确认一下比较好？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e12c8637fa9f75b59ae1b2df64f04e19ac909bb5b7ad0c0d7cfb8b104770e8c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159111dca60d044b7d21279e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到礼物了。\r\n会是吃的吗……可不能让它坏掉，\r\n快点打开吧，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a56772df8ecb843752a4046d06a677a609c11bc5d30ee8bbdaa24e27b14955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d811f177fed0c96fe06fca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有任务达成了。\r\n真厉害，我也要好好努力才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba9d9c0ea1c0cdc66056284650ea9cbf95aac79be60bdec3561be5392647ba60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3543b2b5715b8f214c8e5b88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像快要举办活动了。\r\n觉得心里有点躁动呢……嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb8053ecca83f2f09bcbf275dcc4b651cd2efa10fa0dc14e640db76afa0ddfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6f3ee2c0b24bdccdfb3a0b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在举办活动呢。\r\n……如果能参加的话，\r\n要不要尝试看看呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "647a4c7831f7ea5ee2f6247aed57d360340379e779ca36b5e2c1b9c73b70839c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3e9548dba9fc00e80a09a6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc7a3196bdd725292db568ae04e5f1966973e71b24298f1c97842e56b5561108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03bab12a2ca0d891f68aaa60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a15e68cae399a07a8f123918970af118dd7b67faaefbf35d524d7dec353a77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b55391f22c696bd405619c2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小溪称赞我这件衣服的花样……\r\n是叫……斑点？的颜色很可爱。\r\n我也这么觉得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "406746b74005847eab8da8ec46666b403fa7b80d45f0c05c0e437e8c5f6a35b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c67a01815740a645d7cb94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装是服饰店的阿晴推荐，\r\n她说「这样即使到了都市\r\n也没问题」……真的没问题吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4df038ef0ab04833f1560b25df192584bd05f56a3c6d69e922b2aba689d15f52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a32fd3c3a40aff37d09d7c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我买了练习写硬笔字的书。\r\n因为最近被粉丝要求\r\n签名的机会增加了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b27bb782c2c404d8c778d5947daef755d5432ee38bb74697b1f837fc8b77bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b7d4fc3f179174996887d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也是会有这样的状况呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3d408ab44f4641b44f6852194f9a08c79525c242edfb5c751f4c105c3851cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4017375221bb828f9a4c2d6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2683e66cffb291becf9fcf9338654b262ec1dc080788adf243d2d90ddf838de8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c672ec31d8ec020913cadc83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc7a3196bdd725292db568ae04e5f1966973e71b24298f1c97842e56b5561108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37712f8d71efc4938b667af4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也是会有这样的状况呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3d408ab44f4641b44f6852194f9a08c79525c242edfb5c751f4c105c3851cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5597519907e26e2e22aa582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像更新了最高分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "537db6c70b2e59edd1c27177a911e3983a97f869bde8a1695075a70fcde6031c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbac1417ea46b0db8f49fb9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，全力表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7f5a6fa0b95d94fb27c488ee3ac19ed8a5ce1dbbca0f357b427ae2ce8f4a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f785e01a27cfbc4a402b54df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心強いよ、クリーク。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0caf7e5a87e874affdaabdbe7a263cd2d5d58d1923f209b53c6f0392c10b7698",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a6e3247e413cfbe7b4b9f45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就靠你咯，小玉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f23d47abb65e480f44291d65d064f0d7f5e78f3ef5bab682ebd46218417f9008",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4914749c6a38a4afb252ee4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eec042db55a529c2159fe0c952c35f2fe5b11eccc826ca64cfa1bc13d22a8c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f4f142db32803fa2fa24730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私はお腹を…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0b08ef4b3f59b22ee5e0f70de064a7c0fe2987dc78351630745c2eae5b4aef5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e01e7f7b41574dccb180c505",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a47fffe4bcbcb5e550e4cbcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以随时开始训练哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67034ba46112b6387ac2169e3604fb09d0e44464f64509f5f3b308545deecdd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:057203375c94d65c81dac04f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经历了不少事情呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ee5e7d35232dc414414701527f5bdc5a2f20785383e0b704933d1596b534f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f018b5f35d9c5af759fa260",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名参加比赛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4904075f4a1722bb60be3ee7a8dc6973ac5a113ff28332e1368533ce91222f56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68505e3a86c8f7443c33cbbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fd301806aafa39a38b119d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉到力量在涌现呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "225d013a5e9dd747f809a0cbfc082b3d7aaaf398e7ab5c8013ae2f498cb8f484",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4fe24b50b75b7cd02a295ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85057f766aa80def03d0296ff7310e3f8ee71615cbd1e68722ec011b1ccb4595",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42de8215d023582205caa371",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c0c9f03a76c9e3fef07a9617e8201625b8030f2c5d91111c21a39a71233a3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c60380c293a89b86bbe93ff0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！夹到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b69322568279a65a66d4ea3bfedf645e45c9292092de84c1a61f107c5ad7d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d2e801d6af63d2276e827d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12187ed68d19163af1e014ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我很满意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6e20db3e5fd4506ef10fca6921f5f3ca0e3e479d65e05005e3be28f15f5d80c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "140003"
